### Always ON inside triad / `/super-spec`

When `/spec-kit-openspec-superpowers` or `/super-spec` touches frontend → **auto-load Impeccable** (setup + `polish` or `craft` as fit). Do **not** wait for `/impeccable` or `@impeccable`. **Do not** auto-run agent-browser / Playwright for UI proof (`16-playwright-archived.mdc`).

AFK / G1 / Claude Senior unchanged.

### Activate when (any)

- Task keywords: design, polish, layout, form, component, Vue, CSS, dashboard, landing, UX, a11y, animation, typography
- Files touched: `resources/js/**`, `resources/css/**`, `resources/js/views/**`, `resources/js/components/**`, `*.vue`, `*.css`
- Detail/view pages, form chrome, visual blade wrappers users see in admin
- User invokes `/impeccable` or sub-commands (`craft`, `shape`, `audit`, `polish`, `critique`, etc.)

### Skip when

- Pure backend PHP, API-only, git, docs-only, spec-only with no UI
- PDF **sample** black borders / print table grid fidelity (print contract ≠ admin UI polish)

### On activation

1. Read impeccable `SKILL.md` (don't re-run loader if context already in session).
2. If `PRODUCT.md` exists at repo root (or `.agents/context/`, `docs/`): run from repo root:
   `node C:\Users\PGI\.claude\skills\impeccable\scripts\load-context.mjs`
   Consume full JSON; never pipe through `head`/`grep`/`jq`.
3. **Register:** `product` — Laravel/Vue insurance admin UI (not marketing brand).
4. Load `reference/product.md` for design work; apply shared design laws from SKILL.md.
5. Match existing PrimeVue + Tailwind patterns; extend, don't force full redesign unless asked.
6. **Sub-command routing** — load matching reference before acting:
   `craft`→craft.md, `shape`→shape.md, `audit`→audit.md, `polish`→polish.md, `critique`→critique.md, `teach`→teach.md, `document`→document.md, etc. (see SKILL.md command table).
   Default: **`polish`** for existing screens; **`craft`**/`shape` for new surfaces.
7. Missing/placeholder PRODUCT.md (<200 chars, `[TODO]`): run `teach` first, then resume original task.

